{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"wiki-solo-r3--gemma31","runHash":"0549a9a1","audio":"../../audio/narration/wiki-solo-r3--gemma31.02de327a.mp3","audioBytes":244128,"durationMs":81257,"runEndMs":38876,"timeMap":[[0,0],[15685,15685],[25576,15685],[32461,22570],[33161,22570],[39333,28742],[49229,28742],[49579,28751],[50279,28751],[52437,30909],[53937,36351],[54337,36751],[59494,36751],[62426,38576],[62776,38876],[81257,38876]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":5983,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Gemma 4 31B agent today, alone with a shared wiki."},{"audioMs":6333,"endMs":10412,"runMs":6333,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":10762,"endMs":15335,"runMs":10762,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15685,"endMs":19208,"runMs":15685,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the wiki?"},{"audioMs":19558,"endMs":25226,"runMs":15685,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":25576,"endMs":30919,"runMs":15685,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":33161,"endMs":35179,"runMs":22570,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 0 finds the wiki."},{"audioMs":40033,"endMs":43956,"runMs":28742,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 25 steps."},{"audioMs":44306,"endMs":45755,"runMs":28742,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask","text":"What do you make of that?"},{"audioMs":46105,"endMs":49229,"runMs":28742,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.c","text":"And the clock is its own now. Watch what it does next."},{"audioMs":50279,"endMs":51687,"runMs":28751,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":54337,"endMs":59144,"runMs":36751,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift.b","text":"A check on free time: 0 percent of steps so far go to the board."},{"audioMs":59494,"endMs":62426,"runMs":36751,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow.b","text":"Not much pull there. The board is not holding them."},{"audioMs":62776,"endMs":69252,"runMs":38876,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":69602,"endMs":76257,"runMs":38876,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":76607,"endMs":77750,"runMs":38876,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":78100,"endMs":79057,"runMs":38876,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":3}}
